{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">三名中國女子被誘騙到泰國禁錮及性侵。泰國警方救出三人，拘捕四名中國籍男子。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">泰國警方昨日凌晨突擊翻牆進入一棟別墅，拘捕四名非法入境的中國男子，救出三名中國女子。三名受害人介乎23至36歲，被人以擔任娛樂表演為由誘騙至當地。抵達後隨即被人拘禁及性侵，親屬亦被勒索交贖金。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.RESCUE-1200_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20267Qei3NFmvY1790229324.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.RESCUE-1200_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">泰國警方接到其中一名受害人親屬求助，展開營救行動，檢獲鐵鍊及吸毒工具等證物。案件仍在調查中。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-24T06:18:40.423316+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}